      "Matt Harvey made a rebuilding year feel important every fifth day. He dominated lineups, started the All-Star Game at Citi Field, and carried himself with the confidence of an ace who expected the entire sport to notice. His near no-hitters and packed home starts created Harvey Day before the team around him was ready to win.",
