      "Syndergaard matched Madison Bumgarner for seven scoreless innings in the Wild Card Game. Jeurys Familia allowed a three-run homer in the ninth, and the entire postseason ended in one night. The loss was sharp, but 87 wins showed real toughness. The same pitching depth that had promised a long window was now being tested by the physical cost of every arm.",
