      "deGrom finished with a 1.70 ERA, 269 strikeouts, and only ten wins, forcing voters to look beyond the old win statistic. He won the Cy Young Award easily. Brandon Nimmo became an on-base threat, Zack Wheeler finished with a dominant second half, and Jeff McNeil arrived late to show the pure hitting skill that would keep him in the lineup.",
